### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/health

### Categories
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/categories

### List events (month)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/events?month=2026-05&sort_by=score&limit=10

### List events (range)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/events?from=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-05-31T23:59:59Z&sort_by=start_datetime

### Create event (replace token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Demo CEMS",
  "description": "Evento de prueba del nuevo microservicio",
  "image_url": "https://cdn.example.com/events/demo-cems.png",
  "start_datetime": "2026-05-21T15:00:00Z",
  "end_datetime": "2026-05-21T17:00:00Z",
  "location": "Sala 1",
  "category_id": 2
}

### Toggle favorite (replace event id and token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/events/{{event_id}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

